#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:2
msgid "Windows Guest Customization (Image Preparation)"
msgstr "Personalización de guest Windows (preparación de imagen)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide covers preparing Windows virtual images for provisioning with "
"|morpheus| guest customization — including hostname assignment, network "
"configuration, and Active Directory domain join. The approach varies by "
"cloud type."
msgstr "Esta guía cubre la preparación de imágenes virtuales Windows para el aprovisionamiento con personalización de guest de |morpheus|, incluida la asignación de hostname, configuración de red y unión al dominio de Active Directory. El enfoque varía según el tipo de nube."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:7
msgid "Customization Approaches by Cloud Type"
msgstr "Enfoques de personalización por tipo de nube"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:13
msgid "Cloud Type"
msgstr "Tipo de nube"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:14
msgid "Primary Method"
msgstr "Método principal"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:15
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Cómo funciona"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:16
msgid "HVM (KVM)"
msgstr "HVM (KVM)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:17
msgid "Pre-sysprep'd image"
msgstr "Imagen pre-sysprep"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:18
msgid ""
"Image is sysprep'd before capture. On first boot, Windows completes OOBE,"
" |morpheus| Agent installs and handles hostname/domain join."
msgstr "La imagen se prepara con sysprep antes de la captura. En el primer arranque, Windows completa OOBE, el agente de |morpheus| se instala y gestiona hostname/unión al dominio."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:19
msgid "VMware / VME"
msgstr "VMware / VME"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:20
msgid "Force Guest Customization"
msgstr "Force Guest Customization"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:21
msgid ""
"VM is provisioned from a template with VMware Tools installed. |morpheus|"
" triggers a guest customization pass — transferring the unattend.xml to "
"the running VM, then rebooting to apply hostname, network, and domain "
"settings."
msgstr "La VM se aprovisiona desde una plantilla con VMware Tools instalado. |morpheus| activa un pase de personalización del guest — transfiere unattend.xml a la VM en ejecución y luego reinicia para aplicar hostname, red y ajustes de dominio."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:22
msgid "AWS / Azure / GCP"
msgstr "AWS / Azure / GCP"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:23
msgid "Cloud-native (userdata)"
msgstr "Nativo de la nube (userdata)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:24
msgid ""
"Cloud provider handles customization via instance metadata and userdata. "
"Image prep follows cloud-specific requirements."
msgstr "El proveedor de nube gestiona la personalización mediante metadatos de instancia y userdata. La preparación de la imagen sigue los requisitos específicos de la nube."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:27
msgid "Force Guest Customization (VMware / VME)"
msgstr "Force Guest Customization (VMware / VME)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:29
msgid ""
"On VMware and VME clouds, **Force Guest Customization** works differently"
" than on other platforms:"
msgstr "En nubes VMware y VME, **Force Guest Customization** funciona de manera diferente que en otras plataformas:"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:31
msgid ""
"The VM is provisioned from a template that has **VMware Tools installed**"
" (not necessarily sysprep'd)"
msgstr "La VM se aprovisiona desde una plantilla que tiene **VMware Tools instalado** (no necesariamente preparada con sysprep)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:32
msgid "|morpheus| boots the VM"
msgstr "|morpheus| arranca la VM"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:33
msgid ""
"VMware guest customization transfers an unattend.xml into the running "
"guest via VMware Tools"
msgstr "La personalización de guest de VMware transfiere unattend.xml al guest en ejecución mediante VMware Tools"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:34
msgid ""
"The VM reboots to apply the customization (hostname, network, SID "
"regeneration, domain join)"
msgstr "La VM reinicia para aplicar la personalización (hostname, red, regeneración de SID, unión al dominio)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:36
msgid ""
"This means the source template does **not** need to be in a sysprep'd "
"state — VMware Tools handles the customization injection and triggers the"
" re-specialize pass."
msgstr "Esto significa que la plantilla de origen **no** necesita estar en estado preparado con sysprep — VMware Tools gestiona la inyección de personalización y activa el pase de reespecialización."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:38
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:40
msgid ""
"Force Guest Customization on VMware requires VMware Tools to be installed"
" and running in the template. Without Tools, the customization payload "
"cannot be delivered to the guest."
msgstr "Force Guest Customization en VMware requiere que VMware Tools esté instalado y en ejecución en la plantilla. Sin Tools, la carga de personalización no puede entregarse al guest."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:43
msgid "Pre-Sysprep'd Images (HVM / General Use)"
msgstr "Imágenes pre-sysprep (HVM / uso general)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:45
msgid ""
"For HVM clusters (and any cloud where Force Guest Customization is not "
"available), the image must be **sysprep'd before capture**:"
msgstr "Para clústeres HVM (y cualquier nube donde Force Guest Customization no esté disponible), la imagen debe **prepararse con sysprep antes de la captura**:"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:48
msgid "Step 1: Prepare the Template VM"
msgstr "Paso 1: Preparar la VM plantilla"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:50
msgid "Install Windows (Server 2016, 2019, 2022, 2025 or Windows 10/11)"
msgstr "Instalar Windows (Server 2016, 2019, 2022, 2025 o Windows 10/11)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:51
msgid "Install all Windows Updates"
msgstr "Instalar todas las actualizaciones de Windows"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:52
msgid ""
"Install VirtIO drivers (for HVM — use the **Attach VirtIO Drivers** "
"advanced option during initial ISO provisioning)"
msgstr "Instalar controladores VirtIO (para HVM — utilice la opción avanzada **Attach VirtIO Drivers** durante el aprovisionamiento inicial con ISO)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:53
msgid "Install any required software or roles"
msgstr "Instalar cualquier software o rol requerido"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:54
msgid "Configure Windows Firewall to allow WinRM (port 5985/5986)"
msgstr "Configurar el firewall de Windows para permitir WinRM (puerto 5985/5986)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:57
msgid "Step 2: Sysprep"
msgstr "Paso 2: Sysprep"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:59
msgid ""
"& \"$env:SystemRoot\\System32\\Sysprep\\sysprep.exe\" /generalize /oobe "
"/shutdown"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:63
msgid ""
"The VM shuts down after generalizing. **Do not boot it again** — capture "
"it as a virtual image at this point."
msgstr "La VM se apaga después de generalizar. **No la arranque de nuevo** — captúrela como imagen virtual en este punto."

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:66
msgid "Step 3: Upload as Virtual Image"
msgstr "Paso 3: Cargar como imagen virtual"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:68
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`, click "
":guilabel:`+ Add`, and configure:"
msgstr "Navegue a :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images`, haga clic en :guilabel:`+ Add` y configure:"

