"Triggers guest customization via VMware Tools — transfers unattend.xml "
"and reboots the VM to apply settings. Does NOT require the image to be "
"pre-sysprep'd."
msgstr "Activa la personalización del guest mediante VMware Tools — transfiere unattend.xml y reinicia la VM para aplicar ajustes. NO requiere que la imagen esté pre-sysprep."

